# drizzle-kit computes a content hash of each migration file (stored in
# drizzle.__drizzle_migrations.hash) to decide whether it's already been
# applied. Force LF here so that hash can never drift between a Windows
# checkout and Vercel's Linux build, regardless of contributors' local
# core.autocrlf settings.
drizzle/**/*.sql text eol=lf
drizzle/**/*.json text eol=lf
